      "Language": "swe",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Diagnostic coronary angiography and percutaneous coronary interventions (PCI) are rapidly developing fields. In-house thoracic surgery backup is no longer a prerequisite for PCI. The demand for physicians trained in interventional cardiology has created a need to formalise such education. The Swedish societies of cardiology and thoracic radiology have agreed on a policy document establishing the details of this education. It is the responsibility of the tutor to decide when the pupil has achieved adequate skills."},
